    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201dIs this store really open?\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Retro-style short 2D exploration adventure! Explore the laundromat in the middle of the night and try to clear it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff0aThe story is connected to the story of the previous title [PLEASE KNOCK-before entering my room-].You can play this game even if you haven't played the previous game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u226aOutline\u226b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSelection &amp; Exploration Format: Point &amp; Click + Novel </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDuration: About 30 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb6 types of achievement badges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbComplete all achievements to unlock a secret scenario.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbIn-game commentary: OK until the first lap is completed (not after the first lap, secret scenarios are unlocked)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Not allowed after the first lap, secret scenarios are not allowed)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145540/extras/e18ae5650a5183c059b5bc95b3b3d31d.avif?t=1747970924\" data-has-big width=800 height=720 /></span> </p>",
